      "hints": [
        "Apply junction current conservation, then replace each current using I = V/R."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Kirchhoff’s first law gives I = I₁ + I₂ + I₃.",
        "All three branches have the same potential difference V.",
        "Using I = V/R gives V/R = V/R₁ + V/R₂ + V/R₃.",
        "Divide by V to obtain 1/R = 1/R₁ + 1/R₂ + 1/R₃."
      ],
      "checking": {
